# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: comments in this file are intentionally ASCII-only.
#
# Why: on Windows, `Add-Content` / `Out-File` default to the system ANSI code
# page (GBK on Chinese Windows), so appending Chinese comments silently
# produced a file that was UTF-8 at the top and GBK at the bottom. Git read
# it fine, but strict UTF-8 parsers failed and other editors showed mojibake.
# Keeping this file ASCII removes that failure mode entirely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Dependencies ---
node_modules/

# --- Secrets and credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
deploy/caddy-root.crt
deploy/管理员密码.txt
deploy/初始密码.txt
windows/devtest/

# --- Runtime data: the user's real orders and products ---
app/data/
sync/pouch__all_dbs__/
sync/pouch__*
*.corrupt-*

# --- Build artifacts (rebuildable at any time) ---
# solo single-file build:  node tools/build-solo.mjs
app/dist/
# team hub build:          node tools/build-hub.mjs
windows/dist/
windows/hub/_*
windows/hub/*.exe
windows/hub/*.blob
windows/hub/hub-app.cjs
windows/hub/sea-config.json

# --- Third-party build output (regenerated by script) ---
app/public/vendor/
catalog/out/

# --- Local development caches ---
.npm-cache/
.puppeteer-cache/
.chrome-profile-*
windows/cache/
_couchdb-installer/

# --- Editors and OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
*.tsbuildinfo
debug.log

# --- Scratch space ---
# Commit-message files and other one-off junk go here.
.tmp/
